package musictagger

// Icon geometry, converted from Lucide.
//
// Lucide (https://lucide.dev, ISC licence) draws every icon as strokes on
// a 24 by 24 grid with a 2 unit round-capped line. That is a shape, not a
// glyph, so it can be drawn here exactly as its authors drew it rather
// than approximated by hand — which is what the previous icons were, and
// why the shuffle icon came out looking like a cross.
//
// Curves and arcs are flattened to polylines by the converter in
// scratchpad/lucide_convert.py. The numbers below are those polylines, in
// the original 24 by 24 space; icons.odin scales and strokes them.
//
// Regenerate rather than edit.

